From 01630732357752b510cb55937b3d4902b895aeb3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slwyts <slwyts@foxmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 04:59:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] power: piano: authenticate identified MiPPS adapters in
 kernel

Port the GPL-2.0-only ianchb/xiaomi-mipps-auth exchange using the kernel HMAC-SHA256 library. Keep charging policy limits, expose authentic, and make vendor diagnostics read-only. Requires a valid adapter ID and Xiaomi SVID from ADSP; adapters with missing firmware identity still need work.
